            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Display Toggle 1.02

## Fix

- If your built-in display was disabled and the connected external display is
  unplugged, Display Toggle now automatically turns the built-in display back
  on so you are not left without a visible desktop.

Requires macOS 13 Ventura or later. A purchase includes updates through Display
Toggle 2.x.
]]></description>
